          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-26T12:48:07Z",
          "note": "INFO — A01 (Broken Access Control): The server binds exclusively to 127.0.0.1 (src/server/index.ts L180: server.listen(port, '127.0.0.1', ...)), which is the correct posture for a local developer tool. No network-exposed attack surface exists for the credential routes under normal operation. This is noted as a positive control."
