          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-26T12:48:07Z",
          "note": "INFO — A02 (Cryptographic Failures / Token Masking): GET /api/repositories/:id/credential-options masks tokens with a flat '***' replacement (repositories.ts L332–334). The config endpoint (config.ts L28–30) uses a more informative 'maskToken' that reveals the last 4 characters. The difference in masking strategies between the two endpoints is an inconsistency but not a vulnerability — in the credential-options context, exposing the last 4 chars is unnecessary since the endpoint is only used to select which credential to associate. No action required."
